
### `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Vivado generated files
*.jou
*.log
*.str
*.rpt
*.dcp
*.wdb
*.pb
*.xml

# Vivado generated directories
.cache/
.hw/
.ip_user_files/
.sim/
.xil/
.gen/
runs/
*.runs/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.backup
*.debug

# Vivado project files
*.xpr
*.xpr.bak
*.xpr.user

# Editor files
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Generated bitstream
*.bit
*.bin
